# data/weathercontest.sqlite3 outgrew GitHub's 100MB per-file limit for regular git
# (and git doesn't diff SQLite's binary format well, so every commit bloated the repo
# further). It now lives as the "db-snapshot" GitHub Release asset instead, downloaded/
# re-uploaded by collect.yml each run - see that workflow for details.
